   "text": "If you haven’t heard of the Mini, it’s a five-by-five daily crossword created by Joel Fagliano, a senior puzzle editor. It’s free, it includes pop culture clues, and it can most likely be solved in a matter of minutes — or seconds, the more you play.\nDip your toe in the crossword water by solving the Mini every day. You’ll gather a feel for how the tools work on the app or the web, and you’ll star",
